qvac-grid installs the native server next to its rank worker:

    bin/qvac_grid_server
    bin/qvac_grid_rank_worker

Pass --artifacts the package root, which contains the architecture
directory and registry/models-390acf84e.json:

    lib/qvac-grid/

The server looks for qvac_grid_rank_worker beside its own executable, or at
QVAC_GRID_RANK_WORKER. CUDA, LibTorch, and NCCL are host libraries and are not
bundled in this port.
